9	 * (last name and address) so values that differ only in letter case, in the amount of
10	 * surrounding/internal whitespace, or (for the address) in common street-type
11	 * abbreviations compare equal. Used to detect when a new owner shares a household with an
12	 * existing one, and to derive the stable identifier that owners in the same household share.
